@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Create a valid task
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn Spring layers",
  "description": "Trace a request from controller to database",
  "dueDate": "2030-01-01"
}

### List and filter tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks?status=TODO&page=0&size=20

### Read one task
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1

### Update one task
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn Spring layers",
  "description": "Completed the request trace",
  "status": "DONE",
  "dueDate": "2030-01-01"
}

### See validation errors
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": ""
}

### Delete one task
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1
